# an unknown flag
$ skills sync-manifest --frobnicate
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
sync-manifest: 1 added, 1 dropped, 0 retagged
--- stderr ---

--- overlay.manifest ---
alpha/SKILL.md custom

# a short flag
$ skills sync-manifest -v
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
sync-manifest: 1 added, 1 dropped, 0 retagged
--- stderr ---

--- overlay.manifest ---
alpha/SKILL.md custom

# the equals form of a flag it reads
$ skills sync-manifest --manifest=<WORLD>/overlay.manifest
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
sync-manifest: 1 added, 1 dropped, 0 retagged
--- stderr ---

--- overlay.manifest ---
alpha/SKILL.md custom

